{"openapi":"3.1.0","info":{"title":"PocketPass Public API","version":"1.0.0","description":"The PocketPass API lets integrators read and write golfers, house-account\nbalances, and wallet-pass status for the merchants whose credentials they hold.\n\n**Authentication** is a bearer API key scoped to one merchant. Mint keys under\nSettings → Developers on the dashboard. Send them as:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer gp_live_XXXXXXXX…\n```\n\n**Base URL:** `https://api.pocketpass.golf/api/v1`\n\n**Errors** follow one envelope:\n\n```json\n{ \"error\": { \"code\": \"invalid_request\", \"message\": \"…\", \"details\": {} } }\n```\n\n**Pagination**: cursor-based list endpoints return\n`{ data, meta: { hasMore, nextCursor } }`; pass the cursor back as\n`?cursor=…`.\n\n**Idempotency**: money-moving endpoints require an `Idempotency-Key`\nheader. Reusing the same key returns the original response — a retry can't\ndouble-charge.\n\n## Webhooks\n\nWe POST subscribed events to HTTPS endpoints the merchant has registered.\nThe event catalogue and payload shapes are in the **Webhooks** section\nof this reference; the registration flow and receiver contract are below.\n\n### Registering a receiver\n\nRegistration is dashboard-only today — there's no API for it. A merchant\n**admin** signs in and goes to **Settings → Developers**, opens the\n**Webhook endpoints** panel, and:\n\n1. Pastes the receiver URL (must be `https://` in production; `http://`\n   is accepted only for `localhost` / `*.internal`).\n2. Picks which events to subscribe to. All five is the default.\n3. Copies the returned signing secret (`whsec_…`) into the receiver's\n   config — that's what your code verifies signatures against.\n\nIf you're an integrator serving multiple merchants, ask each merchant to add\nyour receiver URL and hand you back the signing secret. One endpoint\nper merchant — the secret is per-endpoint so you can rotate them\nindependently by deleting and re-adding.\n\n### Verifying a request\n\nEvery request carries `Golfpass-Signature: t=<unix>,v1=<hex>` — HMAC-\nSHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret. Reject a\nrequest whose signature doesn't match, or whose `t` is more than 5\nminutes old, to defeat replay. The `Golfpass-Delivery` header is a\nunique id per attempt — log it and dedupe on the envelope's `id` field\n(network retries can deliver the same event more than once).\n\n### Retries\n\nWe retry a failed delivery with exponential backoff: 1m, 5m, 30m, 2h,\n12h. Five consecutive failed deliveries auto-disable the endpoint;\nyour admin re-enables it from the dashboard once the receiver is fixed.\nAny 2xx response acknowledges receipt — respond fast (under 10s) and\nprocess asynchronously if your handler is slow."},"servers":[{"url":"https://api.pocketpass.golf/api/v1","description":"Production"}],"tags":[{"name":"Customers","description":"The people on your merchant."},{"name":"House accounts","description":"Prepaid / charge balances."},{"name":"Wallet passes","description":"Apple + Google Wallet pass status."}],"security":[{"bearerAuth":[]}],"components":{"securitySchemes":{"bearerAuth":{"type":"http","scheme":"bearer","bearerFormat":"gp_live_XXXXXXXX…"}},"schemas":{"Error":{"type":"object","properties":{"error":{"type":"object","properties":{"code":{"type":"string","enum":["unauthorized","forbidden","not_found","invalid_request","conflict","rate_limited","server_error","insufficient_balance","credit_limit_exceeded","account_frozen"]},"message":{"type":"string"},"details":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":true}},"required":["code","message"]}},"required":["error"]},"ListMeta":{"type":"object","properties":{"hasMore":{"type":"boolean"},"nextCursor":{"type":["string","null"]}},"required":["hasMore","nextCursor"]},"Customer":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"name":{"type":"string"},"email":{"type":["string","null"]},"phone":{"type":["string","null"]},"customerType":{"type":["string","null"]},"customerTypeId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid"},"tier":{"type":["string","null"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","inactive","deleted"]},"memberNo":{"type":["string","null"]},"bagNumber":{"type":["string","null"]},"birthday":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"marketingConsent":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"scanCode":{"type":["string","null"]},"customerNumber":{"type":"string"},"lastSeenAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"visitCount":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"totalSpendCents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"houseAccountBalanceCents":{"type":"integer"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"updatedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},"required":["id","name","status","customerNumber","createdAt","updatedAt"]},"CustomerCreateInput":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"phone":{"type":"string","maxLength":50},"customerTypeId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"birthday":{"type":"string","format":"date"},"marketingConsent":{"type":"boolean"}},"required":["name","email"]},"CustomerUpdateInput":{"type":"object","properties":{"name":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200},"email":{"type":"string","format":"email"},"phone":{"type":"string","maxLength":50},"customerTypeId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid"},"birthday":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date"},"marketingConsent":{"type":["boolean","null"]},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","inactive","deleted"]}}},"HouseAccount":{"type":"object","properties":{"customerId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"balanceCents":{"type":"integer"},"availableCents":{"type":"integer"},"creditLimitCents":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"currency":{"type":"string"},"status":{"type":"string","enum":["active","frozen"]}},"required":["customerId","balanceCents","availableCents","creditLimitCents","currency","status"]},"HouseAccountTransaction":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"customerId":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"type":{"type":"string","enum":["topup","redeem","adjustment","reversal"]},"amountCents":{"type":"integer"},"balanceAfterCents":{"type":"integer"},"source":{"type":"string"},"reason":{"type":["string","null"]},"idempotencyKey":{"type":"string"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},"required":["id","customerId","type","amountCents","balanceAfterCents","source","idempotencyKey","createdAt"]},"HouseAccountTxnCreateInput":{"type":"object","properties":{"type":{"type":"string","enum":["topup","redeem","adjustment"]},"amountCents":{"type":"integer","description":"Signed. Positive credits the golfer; negative debits them. `topup` must be positive; `redeem` must be negative; `adjustment` accepts either."},"reason":{"type":"string","maxLength":200}},"required":["type","amountCents"]},"WalletPass":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"customerId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid"},"reservationId":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"uuid"},"kind":{"type":"string","enum":["customer","tee_time"]},"serialNumber":{"type":"string"},"installedApple":{"type":"boolean"},"installedGoogle":{"type":"boolean"},"appleLastSignedAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"googleLastPatchedAt":{"type":["string","null"],"format":"date-time"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"updatedAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}},"required":["id","kind","serialNumber","installedApple","installedGoogle","createdAt","updatedAt"]},"WebhookEnvelope":{"type":"object","properties":{"id":{"type":"string","format":"uuid","description":"Stable delivery id. Receivers dedupe on it — a network hiccup can deliver the same event twice."},"type":{"type":"string","description":"The event name (e.g. `customer.created`)."},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"data":{"type":"object","description":"The resource payload — see the per-event operation below."}},"required":["id","type","createdAt","data"]}}},"paths":{"/customers":{"get":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"List customers","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"status","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["active","inactive","deleted"]}},{"name":"updated_since","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListMeta"}},"required":["data","meta"]}}}},"401":{"description":"Missing or invalid API key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"Create a customer","requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CustomerCreateInput"}}}},"responses":{"201":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}},"required":["data"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation failed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"409":{"description":"A customer with that email already exists.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/customers/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"Get a customer","description":"`id` is either the customer's UUID or their email address (case-insensitive).","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Customer UUID or email address."},"examples":{"uuid":{"value":"9c5a0f6a-3f6b-4c9a-9a0b-2e6f0d8b1c11"},"email":{"value":"matt@example.com"}}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}},"required":["data"]}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}},"patch":{"tags":["Customers"],"summary":"Update a customer","description":"`id` is either the customer's UUID or their email address (case-insensitive).","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Customer UUID or email address."}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/CustomerUpdateInput"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}},"required":["data"]}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation failed.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/house-accounts/{customerId}":{"get":{"tags":["House accounts"],"summary":"Get a customer's house-account summary","description":"`customerId` is either the customer's UUID or their email address (case-insensitive).","parameters":[{"name":"customerId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Customer UUID or email address."},"examples":{"uuid":{"value":"9c5a0f6a-3f6b-4c9a-9a0b-2e6f0d8b1c11"},"email":{"value":"matt@example.com"}}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HouseAccount"}},"required":["data"]}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/house-accounts/{customerId}/transactions":{"get":{"tags":["House accounts"],"summary":"List a customer's transactions","description":"`customerId` is either the customer's UUID or their email address (case-insensitive).","parameters":[{"name":"customerId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Customer UUID or email address."}},{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"offset","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HouseAccountTransaction"}},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListMeta"}},"required":["data","meta"]}}}}}},"post":{"tags":["House accounts"],"summary":"Post a transaction","description":"`customerId` is either the customer's UUID or their email address (case-insensitive). Requires an `Idempotency-Key` header. Reusing the same key returns the original transaction with `idempotent: true` and does not move money.","parameters":[{"name":"customerId","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","description":"Customer UUID or email address."}},{"name":"Idempotency-Key","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","minLength":8,"maxLength":128}}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HouseAccountTxnCreateInput"}}}},"responses":{"200":{"description":"Idempotent replay — same as 201."},"201":{"description":"Transaction posted.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HouseAccountTransaction"},{"type":"object","properties":{"availableCents":{"type":"integer"},"idempotent":{"type":"boolean"}}}]}}}}}},"400":{"description":"Validation failed or missing Idempotency-Key.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"404":{"description":"Customer not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}},"422":{"description":"Refused by house-account rules (`insufficient_balance`, `credit_limit_exceeded`, `account_frozen`).","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}},"/wallet-passes":{"get":{"tags":["Wallet passes"],"summary":"List wallet passes","parameters":[{"name":"limit","in":"query","schema":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":200,"default":50}},{"name":"cursor","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string"}},{"name":"customer_id","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}},{"name":"kind","in":"query","schema":{"type":"string","enum":["customer","tee_time"]}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"type":"array","items":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletPass"}},"meta":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/ListMeta"}},"required":["data","meta"]}}}}}}},"/wallet-passes/{id}":{"get":{"tags":["Wallet passes"],"summary":"Get a wallet pass","parameters":[{"name":"id","in":"path","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"}}],"responses":{"200":{"description":"OK","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletPass"}},"required":["data"]}}}},"404":{"description":"Not found.","content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Error"}}}}}}}},"webhooks":{"customer.created":{"post":{"tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"customer.created","description":"A new golfer was added to your merchant — from a Lightspeed Golf sync, a dashboard add, or a POST to `/v1/customers`.","parameters":[{"name":"Golfpass-Signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1735689600,v1=<hex>"},"description":"HMAC-SHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret."},{"name":"Golfpass-Event","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The event name, matching the `type` field in the body."},{"name":"Golfpass-Delivery","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Unique per delivery attempt. Log this if you need to correlate with support."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEnvelope"},{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}}}]}}}},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Any 2xx response acknowledges the delivery. Body ignored."}}}},"customer.updated":{"post":{"tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"customer.updated","description":"Any change to an existing customer row (name, email, customer type, marketing consent, tier, commerce facts).","parameters":[{"name":"Golfpass-Signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1735689600,v1=<hex>"},"description":"HMAC-SHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret."},{"name":"Golfpass-Event","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The event name, matching the `type` field in the body."},{"name":"Golfpass-Delivery","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Unique per delivery attempt. Log this if you need to correlate with support."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEnvelope"},{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}}}]}}}},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Any 2xx response acknowledges the delivery. Body ignored."}}}},"customer.deleted":{"post":{"tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"customer.deleted","description":"A customer was soft-deleted (`status` moved to `deleted`). The row and their wallet pass are kept for audit.","parameters":[{"name":"Golfpass-Signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1735689600,v1=<hex>"},"description":"HMAC-SHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret."},{"name":"Golfpass-Event","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The event name, matching the `type` field in the body."},{"name":"Golfpass-Delivery","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Unique per delivery attempt. Log this if you need to correlate with support."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEnvelope"},{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/Customer"}}}]}}}},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Any 2xx response acknowledges the delivery. Body ignored."}}}},"house_account.transaction.created":{"post":{"tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"house_account.transaction.created","description":"A house-account transaction posted from any surface — dashboard, POS, Stripe top-up, or a POST to `/v1/house-accounts/{customerId}/transactions`.","parameters":[{"name":"Golfpass-Signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1735689600,v1=<hex>"},"description":"HMAC-SHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret."},{"name":"Golfpass-Event","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The event name, matching the `type` field in the body."},{"name":"Golfpass-Delivery","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Unique per delivery attempt. Log this if you need to correlate with support."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEnvelope"},{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/HouseAccountTransaction"}}}]}}}},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Any 2xx response acknowledges the delivery. Body ignored."}}}},"wallet_pass.installed":{"post":{"tags":["Webhooks"],"summary":"wallet_pass.installed","description":"The golfer added their pass to Apple Wallet (first device) or saved it to Google Wallet. Includes the pass with current install status.","parameters":[{"name":"Golfpass-Signature","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","example":"t=1735689600,v1=<hex>"},"description":"HMAC-SHA256 of `${t}.${body}` with the endpoint's signing secret."},{"name":"Golfpass-Event","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string"},"description":"The event name, matching the `type` field in the body."},{"name":"Golfpass-Delivery","in":"header","required":true,"schema":{"type":"string","format":"uuid"},"description":"Unique per delivery attempt. Log this if you need to correlate with support."}],"requestBody":{"required":true,"content":{"application/json":{"schema":{"allOf":[{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WebhookEnvelope"},{"type":"object","properties":{"data":{"$ref":"#/components/schemas/WalletPass"}}}]}}}},"responses":{"2XX":{"description":"Any 2xx response acknowledges the delivery. Body ignored."}}}}}}